@startuml
title Widok modułów — rzeczywiste pakiety
top to bottom direction
package "desktop — prezentacja" {
  [app / pages / flows] as GUI
  [profile_forms / dashboard / discover / krakow] as Pages
  [client.py] as Client
}
package "admissions — API i przypadki użycia" {
  [api / auth] as API
  [services / profiles / offers / housing / mailing] as Services
  [domain / policies / tuition] as Rules
  [models / migrations] as Persistence
}
package "uruchomienie i eksploatacja" {
  [start / portable / networking] as Host
  [backups] as Copies
  [database — pomiary i modele] as DBTools
}
GUI --> Pages
Pages --> Client
Client ..> API : kontrakt JSON, brak importów modeli do GUI
API --> Services
Services --> Rules
Services --> Persistence
Host --> API
Host --> Persistence : migracje
Copies --> Persistence : dump / restore
DBTools --> Persistence : izolowane kopie i metadane
note right of Rules
  domain.py nie zależy od ORM ani Qt.
  Testy obejmują osobno reguły i przebieg.
end note
@enduml
